Seasonal Tilesets
4 variety tilesets for platforming games!

Everything works best on a 16 x 16 grid setup. Backgrounds come with both flat, static images and separated layers for parallax scrolling!

Also includes extra scenery objects: blocks, water, and even a house! Water, lava and bubbling oil tiles can be animated!

Grassland - Vast, green landscape! Great for first levels!
Autumn Forest - Don't get lost in this dense, red and orange wood!
Tropics - Enjoy the warm air and cool waters on this island landscape!
Winter World - Venture around a tall, snowy mountain!
